{"product_id":"mortal-chaos","title":"Mortal chaos","description":"\u003cp\u003e'The Butterfly Effect ': the scientific theory that a single occurrence, no matter how small, can change the course of the universe forever. When a butterfly startles a young rabbit, and the rabbit makes a horse rear, it starts a chain of events, over the course of one day, that will change people's lives . . . and end people's lives. From a climber on Everest to a boy in Malawi . . . from a commercial pilot to an American psycho . . . the chaos knows no bounds. This heart-stopping adventure by writer, film maker and climber Matt Dickinson will leave readers breathless. It's the book Jack Bauer would have read as a teenager! \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:20 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Matt Dickinson \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780192757135 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45556218101913,"sku":"7RD9780192757135","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/d181f5b3c7ece49951d640bf30c74550.jpg?v=1752150929","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/mortal-chaos","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}